WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.347
Press D for our new Kit track, then choose pad one on Sound. Open Browse, Samples, and Search. Clear any old text, enter LOOP, and confirm.

2
00:00:10.421 --> 00:00:16.810
Shift and pad thirteen selects the prepared loop. Press the dial to load the whole loop onto pad one.

3
00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:22.110
Hold Menu and press pad sixteen to return to Sound, then press the dial to open the waveform.

4
00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:29.743
Press Plus three times for four slices. On a Kit track, this divides the edited sample evenly across successive pads.

5
00:00:29.743 --> 00:00:35.832
Press the dial to keep those slices, then Shift Main opens Play. The loop is ready to rearrange with your fingers.

6
00:00:35.832 --> 00:00:43.588
Try one, three, two, four. You've got pieces of the original loop, in a different order. Stop and wait for Saved. Now make a beat with them.
